#: src/Modules/Settings/Admin/SettingsPage.php:170
msgid "The logo was not changed: use a PNG, JPEG or WebP image. SVG is not allowed."
msgstr "Logoet blev ikke ændret: brug et PNG-, JPEG- eller WebP-billede. SVG er ikke tilladt."

#: src/Modules/Settings/Admin/SettingsPage.php:171
msgid "The logo was not changed: the image must be at least 64 px high, at most 2000 px on the longest side, and between square and six times as wide as high."
msgstr "Logoet blev ikke ændret: billedet skal være mindst 64 px højt, højst 2000 px på den længste side og mellem kvadratisk og seks gange så bredt som højt."

#: src/Modules/Settings/Admin/SettingsPage.php:172
msgid "The logo was not changed: the image must be stored on this site, not on another domain."
msgstr "Logoet blev ikke ændret: billedet skal ligge på dette site, ikke på et andet domæne."

#: src/Modules/Settings/Admin/SettingsPage.php:173
msgid "A technical error occurred. The settings were not changed."
msgstr "Der opstod en teknisk fejl. Indstillingerne blev ikke ændret."

#: src/Modules/Settings/Admin/SettingsPage.php:209
msgid "Deactivating the plugin never deletes data. Deleting the plugin also keeps all data unless permanent deletion is enabled here."
msgstr "Deaktivering af pluginet sletter aldrig data. Sletning af pluginet bevarer også alle data, medmindre permanent sletning er slået til her."

#: src/Modules/Settings/Admin/SettingsPage.php:212
msgid "Permanent deletion is ENABLED."
msgstr "Permanent sletning er SLÅET TIL."

#: src/Modules/Settings/Admin/SettingsPage.php:213
msgid "When the plugin is deleted from the Plugins screen, the Merch Dashboard data listed below is permanently removed."
msgstr "Når pluginet slettes fra siden Plugins, fjernes de Merch Dashboard-data, der er nævnt nedenfor, permanent."

#: src/Modules/Settings/Admin/SettingsPage.php:216
msgid "Permanent deletion is off. Deleting the plugin keeps all Merch Dashboard data."
msgstr "Permanent sletning er slået fra. Sletning af pluginet bevarer alle Merch Dashboard-data."

#: src/Modules/Settings/Admin/SettingsPage.php:219
msgid "If enabled, deleting the plugin permanently removes: the sales ledger, pricing and VAT data, creator metadata and categories, the encrypted payment details of payout requests, the creators' links to products and WordPress users, the Merch Dashboard settings and schema state, the \"Merch Dashboard Creator\" role and all merchboard_ capabilities. This cannot be undone."
msgstr "Hvis det er slået til, fjerner sletning af pluginet permanent: salgsledgeren, pris- og momsdata, creator-metadata og -kategorier, de krypterede betalingsoplysninger på udbetalingsanmodninger, creators' koblinger til produkter og WordPress-brugere, Merch Dashboards indstillinger og skemastatus, rollen \"Merch Dashboard Creator\" og alle merchboard_-rettigheder. Det kan ikke fortrydes."

#: src/Modules/Settings/Admin/SettingsPage.php:220
msgid "Kept as historical documentation: the payout history, the settlement documents with their rows and numbering, the audit log and the creators. Every creator is archived: set to inactive and unlinked from its WordPress user, so no one gets dashboard access. Payment details are only kept masked (e.g. the last four digits of an account)."
msgstr "Bevares som historisk dokumentation: udbetalingshistorikken, afregningsbilagene med rækker og nummerering, auditloggen og creators. Alle creators arkiveres: de sættes til inaktive og frakobles deres WordPress-bruger, så ingen får adgang til dashboardet. Betalingsoplysninger bevares kun maskeret (fx de sidste fire cifre i et kontonummer)."

#: src/Modules/Settings/Admin/SettingsPage.php:221
msgid "Installing the plugin again shows this history, but only as documentation: reactivating an archived creator and normal payouts for it are not supported. The sales ledger is then rebuilt from the products' current creator links, so orders can be attributed to another creator than in the kept settlement documents, and balances, payouts and documents would not match."
msgstr "Installeres pluginet igen, vises denne historik, men kun som dokumentation: det understøttes ikke at genaktivere en arkiveret creator eller at lave almindelige udbetalinger til den. Salgsledgeren genopbygges da ud fra produkternes nuværende creator-koblinger, så ordrer kan blive tilskrevet en anden creator end i de bevarede afregningsbilag, og saldi, udbetalinger og bilag ville ikke stemme overens."

#: src/Modules/Settings/Admin/SettingsPage.php:222
msgid "While a payout is pending, deleting the plugin deletes nothing and is refused, so the pending payouts can still be handled."
msgstr "Så længe en udbetaling afventer, slettes intet, og sletning af pluginet afvises, så de ventende udbetalinger stadig kan behandles."

#: src/Modules/Settings/Admin/SettingsPage.php:223
msgid "Never removed: WordPress users, other roles and capabilities, posts, pages, media and WooCommerce products, orders and customers."
msgstr "Fjernes aldrig: WordPress-brugere, andre roller og rettigheder, indlæg, sider, medier samt WooCommerce-produkter, -ordrer og -kunder."

#: src/Modules/Settings/Admin/SettingsPage.php:229
msgid "Permanent deletion"
msgstr "Permanent sletning"

#: src/Modules/Settings/Admin/SettingsPage.php:231
msgid "Delete Merch Dashboard data when the plugin is deleted (the history listed above is kept)"
msgstr "Slet Merch Dashboard-data, når pluginet slettes (historikken ovenfor bevares)"

#: src/Modules/Settings/Admin/SettingsPage.php:235
msgid "Confirmation"
msgstr "Bekræftelse"

#. translators: %s: the word to type, "DELETE".
#: src/Modules/Settings/Admin/SettingsPage.php:238
#, php-format
msgid "To enable permanent deletion, also type %s here."
msgstr "For at slå permanent sletning til skal du også skrive %s her."

#: src/Modules/Settings/Admin/SettingsPage.php:243
msgid "Save settings"
msgstr "Gem indstillinger"

#: src/Modules/Settings/Admin/SettingsPage.php:265
msgid "Whether payouts are pending cannot be checked right now. Deleting the plugin is refused until it can."
msgstr "Det kan ikke kontrolleres lige nu, om der er ventende udbetalinger. Sletning af pluginet afvises, indtil det kan."

#. translators: %d: number of pending payouts.
#: src/Modules/Settings/Admin/SettingsPage.php:267
#, php-format
msgid "%d payout is pending. Deleting the plugin now deletes nothing and is refused; handle it under Payouts first."
msgid_plural "%d payouts are pending. Deleting the plugin now deletes nothing and is refused; handle them under Payouts first."
msgstr[0] "%d udbetaling afventer. Slettes pluginet nu, slettes intet, og sletningen afvises; behandl den først under Udbetalinger."
msgstr[1] "%d udbetalinger afventer. Slettes pluginet nu, slettes intet, og sletningen afvises; behandl dem først under Udbetalinger."

#: src/Modules/Settings/Admin/SettingsPage.php:283
msgid "Branding"
msgstr "Branding"

#: src/Modules/Settings/Admin/SettingsPage.php:284
msgid "The logo is shown at the top of the creator dashboard and on the WordPress login page when creators log in to their dashboard. Other login pages are not changed."
msgstr "Logoet vises øverst i creator-dashboardet og på WordPress-login-siden, når creators logger ind på deres dashboard. Andre login-sider ændres ikke."

#: src/Modules/Settings/Admin/SettingsPage.php:287
msgid "The chosen logo can no longer be used (deleted, changed or not on this site), so the default logo is shown."
msgstr "Det valgte logo kan ikke længere bruges (slettet, ændret eller ikke på dette site), så standardlogoet vises."

#: src/Modules/Settings/Admin/SettingsPage.php:295
msgid "Logo"
msgstr "Logo"

#: src/Modules/Settings/Admin/SettingsPage.php:298
msgid "Current logo"
msgstr "Nuværende logo"

#: src/Modules/Settings/Admin/SettingsPage.php:301
msgid "A custom logo is in use."
msgstr "Et eget logo er i brug."

#: src/Modules/Settings/Admin/SettingsPage.php:301
msgid "The default Merch Dashboard logo is in use."
msgstr "Standardlogoet for Merch Dashboard er i brug."

#: src/Modules/Settings/Admin/SettingsPage.php:302
msgid "Choose logo"
msgstr "Vælg logo"

#: src/Modules/Settings/Admin/SettingsPage.php:303
msgid "PNG, JPEG or WebP from the Media Library, at least 64 px high, at most 2000 px on the longest side, and between square and six times as wide as high. SVG is not allowed. Use a logo that is readable on a light background; on dark dashboard themes it is shown on a light plate."
msgstr "PNG, JPEG eller WebP fra mediebiblioteket, mindst 64 px højt, højst 2000 px på den længste side og mellem kvadratisk og seks gange så bredt som højt. SVG er ikke tilladt. Brug et logo, der kan læses på lys baggrund; på mørke dashboard-temaer vises det på en lys plade."

#: src/Modules/Settings/Admin/SettingsPage.php:306
msgid "Save logo"
msgstr "Gem logo"

#: src/Modules/Settings/Admin/SettingsPage.php:310
