msgid "Permanently deletes what Merch Dashboard has stored for this order: its ledger rows, cycle events, stored tax and profit snapshots. The order disappears from the creator's sales, statistics and profit. The WooCommerce order is not changed. If it is restored from the trash later, it is registered again without profit data. This cannot be undone."
msgstr "Sletter permanent det, Merch Dashboard har gemt for denne ordre: ledger-rækker, cyklushændelser, gemt moms og profit-snapshots. Ordren forsvinder fra creatorens salg, statistik og profit. WooCommerce-ordren ændres ikke. Gendannes den senere fra papirkurven, registreres den igen uden profitdata. Det kan ikke fortrydes."

#. translators: %d: order id.
#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/OrderHistoryPage.php:517
#, php-format
msgid "Type the order ID (%d) to confirm"
msgstr "Skriv ordre-ID'et (%d) for at bekræfte"

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/OrderHistoryPage.php:530
msgid "Nothing was deleted: the typed order ID did not match."
msgstr "Intet blev slettet: det indtastede ordre-ID passede ikke."

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/OrderHistoryPage.php:531
msgid "Nothing was deleted: the WooCommerce order is not in the trash or deleted."
msgstr "Intet blev slettet: WooCommerce-ordren ligger ikke i papirkurven og er ikke slettet."

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/OrderHistoryPage.php:532
msgid "Nothing was deleted: Merch Dashboard has no stored history for the order."
msgstr "Intet blev slettet: Merch Dashboard har ingen gemt historik for ordren."

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/OrderHistoryPage.php:533
msgid "Nothing was deleted: the order is being synchronized right now. Please try again."
msgstr "Intet blev slettet: ordren synkroniseres lige nu. Prøv igen."

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/OrderHistoryPage.php:534
msgid "Nothing was deleted: the order is part of a settlement document, so its history is kept."
msgstr "Intet blev slettet: ordren indgår i et afregningsbilag, så dens historik bevares."

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/OrderHistoryPage.php:536
msgid "Nothing was deleted: the order history could not be deleted. Please try again later."
msgstr "Intet blev slettet: ordrehistorikken kunne ikke slettes. Prøv igen senere."

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/OrderHistoryPage.php:544
msgid "About the profit data"
msgstr "Om profitdata"

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/OrderHistoryPage.php:547
msgid "Complete: every ledger row of the order has its profit snapshot and its stored tax, so the creator profit can be calculated (ADR-049)."
msgstr "Komplet: alle ordrens ledger-rækker har deres profit-snapshot og gemte moms, så creator-profitten kan beregnes (ADR-049)."

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/OrderHistoryPage.php:548
msgid "Incomplete: some rows have the data, others do not. Unknown: no row has it. Missing history is never filled in, recalculated from current settings or shown as 0."
msgstr "Ufuldstændig: nogle rækker har data, andre ikke. Ukendt: ingen række har dem. Manglende historik udfyldes aldrig, genberegnes aldrig ud fra nuværende indstillinger og vises aldrig som 0."

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/OrderHistoryPage.php:551
msgid "The sales ledger, profit snapshots and stored tax are append-only. The one exception: an administrator can delete the stored history of one order once the WooCommerce order is in the trash or deleted, e.g. a test order. That removes the order from the creator's sales and profit and is recorded in the audit log."
msgstr "Salgsledgeren, profit-snapshots og gemt moms er append-only. Den eneste undtagelse: en administrator kan slette den gemte historik for én ordre, når WooCommerce-ordren ligger i papirkurven eller er slettet, fx en testordre. Det fjerner ordren fra creatorens salg og profit og registreres i audit-loggen."

#. translators: 1: rows with known profit, 2: rows without the data.
#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/OrderHistoryPage.php:575
#, php-format
msgid "%1$d known, %2$d without data"
msgstr "%1$d kendte, %2$d uden data"

