#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/PayoutsPage.php:941
msgid "Transfer the amount yourself (bank or PayPal) first. Registering it here sends no money; it only records that the transfer has been made. The creator's balance is checked again, and a payout it no longer covers is refused for manual handling."
msgstr "Overfør først selv beløbet (bank eller PayPal). En registrering her sender ingen penge; den registrerer kun, at overførslen er foretaget. Creatorens saldo kontrolleres igen, og en udbetaling, den ikke længere dækker, afvises til manuel behandling."

