msgid "Tax and reporting"
msgstr "Skat og indberetning"

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Payouts/Settlements/SettlementPdf.php:257
#: build/dashboard.js:16
msgid "You are responsible for finding out about and meeting your own tax and reporting obligations to the Danish Tax Agency. Depending on your situation, this may include whether the amount must be included in your taxable income and whether you have VAT obligations. This document shows the payout and its basis according to the information registered in the system. It is not tax advice and has not been approved by an auditor or the Danish Tax Agency."
msgstr "Du er selv ansvarlig for at undersøge og opfylde dine skatte- og indberetningsforpligtelser over for Skattestyrelsen. Det kan blandt andet afhænge af din situation, om beløbet skal medregnes i din skattepligtige indkomst, og om du har momsforpligtelser. Dette bilag viser udbetalingen og grundlaget for den ud fra de oplysninger, der er registreret i systemet. Bilaget er ikke skatterådgivning og er ikke godkendt af en revisor eller Skattestyrelsen."

