msgstr "Ukendt bruger"

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/OrderHistoryPage.php:568
msgid "Open case – creator discount code"
msgstr "Åben sag – creator-rabatkode"

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/OrderHistoryPage.php:569
msgid "Excluded – creator discount code"
msgstr "Udelukket – creator-rabatkode"

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/OrderHistoryPage.php:594
msgid "Orders excluded by creator discount codes"
msgstr "Ordrer udelukket af creator-rabatkoder"

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/OrderHistoryPage.php:595
msgid "An order that used a creator's own discount code counts nowhere: not in sales, profit, payouts or new settlement documents. The decision is made once and is permanent. An open case is an order that was already settled; its settled rows and documents are not changed, and the case is not resolved automatically."
msgstr "En ordre, der brugte en creators egen rabatkode, tæller ingen steder: hverken i salg, fortjeneste, udbetalinger eller nye afregningsbilag. Afgørelsen træffes én gang og er varig. En åben sag er en ordre, der allerede var afregnet; dens afregnede rækker og bilag ændres ikke, og sagen afgøres ikke automatisk."

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/OrderHistoryPage.php:597
msgid "All excluded orders"
msgstr "Alle udelukkede ordrer"

#. translators: %s: number of open cases.
#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/OrderHistoryPage.php:600
#, php-format
msgid "Open cases (%s)"
msgstr "Åbne sager (%s)"

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/OrderHistoryPage.php:608
msgid "No orders are excluded."
msgstr "Ingen ordrer er udelukket."

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/OrderHistoryPage.php:614
msgid "Order created"
msgstr "Ordre oprettet"

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/OrderHistoryPage.php:625
msgid "The coupon deviated from the registration when the order was decided."
msgstr "Kuponen afveg fra registreringen, da ordren blev afgjort."

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/OrderHistoryPage.php:668
msgid "The order already had rows in a settlement document. Those rows and documents are not changed; the order's other rows do not count. The case is not resolved automatically."
msgstr "Ordren havde allerede rækker i et afregningsbilag. De rækker og bilag ændres ikke; ordrens øvrige rækker tæller ikke. Sagen afgøres ikke automatisk."

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/OrderHistoryPage.php:669
msgid "None of the order's rows count in sales, profit, payouts or new settlement documents, and no new ledger events are stored for it."
msgstr "Ingen af ordrens rækker tæller i salg, fortjeneste, udbetalinger eller nye afregningsbilag, og der gemmes ingen nye ledger-hændelser for den."

#. translators: 1: creator name, 2: discount code, 3: date.
#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/OrderHistoryPage.php:672
#, php-format
msgid "the order used the discount code of %1$s (%2$s); decided %3$s."
msgstr "ordren brugte rabatkoden fra %1$s (%2$s); afgjort %3$s."

#: src/Modules/WooCommerce/Admin/OrderHistoryPage.php:675
msgid "The coupon deviated from the registration when the order was decided (it was missing or had another ID). The order is excluded all the same."
msgstr "Kuponen afveg fra registreringen, da ordren blev afgjort (den manglede eller havde et andet ID). Ordren er udelukket alligevel."

